<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
  <html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
  <head>
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
  </head><body>
  Dear $CLIENTNAME,<br/>

<p>
Please be advised that you have recently been added as a client to $COMPANY&#180;s $productName account and were given client account at $productName (<a href="$HOST">$HOST</a>).
 We have noticed that your account still has not been activated. If you are having any difficulties with activating your account and/or getting started with $productName feel free to contact us.
</p>
<p>
  You can access $productName, which is web based, and review your Projects performance and development, view your Invoices, raise issues as well as receive alerts and reports on the Project Development process. Because it is web based it is easy to access anytime and assists you in being on top of your projects.
</p>
<p>
In order to activate your account please <a href="$HOST/auth/account?uid=$uid&cid=$companyid&sid=$serviceid">click here</a>.
You can begin using your $productName account in just a few minutes.
<br/>
(or copy/paste the following address into your web browser: $HOST/auth/account?uid=$uid&cid=$companyid&sid=$serviceid).
</p>
<p>
Thank you for your interest in our product. We are looking forward to working with you and helping you to discover the full potential of $productName.
</p>

<p>Kind Regards,<br/>
Nilufar Nurmanova<br/>
$productName support team
</p>
$companyInfo
</body></html>
